1
00:02:30,984 --> 00:02:37,524
This is the time known as the Great Pirate Era.

2
00:02:37,844 --> 00:02:41,844
A countless array of pirates go to battle across the seas in search of the One Piece,

3
00:02:42,084 --> 00:02:46,044
a legendary treasure left behind by Gold Roger, King of the Pirates.

4
00:02:46,644 --> 00:02:50,904
Munky D. Luffy, a boy whose body turned to rubber after eating the gum gum fruit,

5
00:02:51,184 --> 00:02:53,664
set sail to become the next King of the Pirates.

6
00:02:54,044 --> 00:02:56,624
As Luffy and his crew conquer numerous obstacles,

7
00:02:56,944 --> 00:02:59,764
they capture the unwanted attention of the world government,

8
00:02:59,764 --> 00:03:02,824
which will use any means necessary to stop them.

9
00:03:04,684 --> 00:03:06,024
This is exciting!

10
00:03:06,664 --> 00:03:09,624
I can't wait to see what kind of adventure's up next!

11
00:03:10,144 --> 00:03:13,184
With a charted course awash in danger and intrigue,

12
00:03:13,404 --> 00:03:17,464
the crew will cover path across the Grand Line to the New World.

13
00:03:20,444 --> 00:03:24,484
The Straw Hat crew, leading their ship coated before their journey to Fishman Island,

14
00:03:24,904 --> 00:03:28,244
landed on the Sabaody Archipelago in search of a coating mechanic.

15
00:03:28,244 --> 00:03:33,744
Little did they know, the man they were looking for was once the vice-captain of the Roger Pirates.

16
00:03:34,384 --> 00:03:38,964
After finding him, they were ambushed by Sentomaru of the Marine Science Unit.

17
00:03:38,964 --> 00:03:40,304
Where are you from?

18
00:03:40,304 --> 00:03:40,804
Where are you from?

19
00:03:40,804 --> 00:03:41,304
Where are you from?

20
00:03:41,304 --> 00:03:41,684
Where are you from?

21
00:03:42,684 --> 00:03:43,244
Luffy!

22
00:03:43,244 --> 00:03:49,904
To make matters worse, they were also pitted against the Marine Admiral Kizaru,

23
00:03:50,024 --> 00:03:53,144
who proved too deadly a foe for the exhausted Straw Hats.

24
00:03:57,884 --> 00:04:01,004
Well, you'll have plenty of time to rest up now.

25
00:04:03,724 --> 00:04:04,244
ZARU!

26
00:04:04,244 --> 00:04:20,804
Are you sure you want to do this, Dark King Rayleigh?

27
00:04:20,804 --> 00:04:25,184
Don't go picking these buds before they sprout.

28
00:04:25,604 --> 00:04:29,604
Their era is only just beginning, and I want to see what they do with it.

29
00:04:30,604 --> 00:04:31,124
