30
00:04:33,124 --> 00:04:36,264
Thanks to Rayleigh's help, the crew made a hasty retreat.

31
00:04:36,524 --> 00:04:41,364
But before they could celebrate, they were stopped dead in their tracks by Bartholomew Kumar,

32
00:04:41,364 --> 00:04:43,064
a warlord of the sea.

33
00:04:43,064 --> 00:04:51,964
You and I will never meet again.

34
00:04:58,964 --> 00:05:00,264
Farewell, Straw Hat.

35
00:05:06,864 --> 00:05:10,644
And so the Straw Hat crew disappeared from Zabahodi,

36
00:05:10,644 --> 00:05:13,304
suffering absolute defeat.

37
00:05:16,364 --> 00:05:17,004
