38
00:05:17,344 --> 00:05:19,964
The all-female island Amazon Lily!

39
00:05:25,724 --> 00:05:26,544
Damn it.

40
00:05:26,764 --> 00:05:31,164
If I could just wink right, I'd be even more handsome.

41
00:05:31,164 --> 00:05:32,144
Put-a-put-a-put-a-put-a.

42
00:05:32,564 --> 00:05:33,884
Put-a-put-a-put-a-put-a.

43
00:05:34,564 --> 00:05:35,124
Click.

44
00:05:35,424 --> 00:05:36,944
Good news, Duval, we found it!

45
00:05:37,184 --> 00:05:38,684
It's at a bay by group 41.

46
00:05:39,264 --> 00:05:40,224
