60
00:06:03,604 --> 00:06:05,984
I hope the young master and his friends are all right.

61
00:06:06,984 --> 00:06:09,084
What do you mean you haven't caught them?

62
00:06:09,584 --> 00:06:14,004
Admiral Kizaru is pursuing them as we speak, so I'm sure it's only a matter of time until

63
00:06:14,004 --> 00:06:14,944
