67
00:06:28,564 --> 00:06:32,644
And yet I must save my contempt for the pirates who made a mockery of our bloodline.

68
00:06:33,384 --> 00:06:39,444
When you catch those heathens, I'll show them a true living hell until they beg for death

69
00:06:39,444 --> 00:06:40,544
