93
00:07:45,404 --> 00:07:46,964
I hope you're right.

94
00:07:47,184 --> 00:07:48,244
Knock it off, Kamey.

95
00:07:48,464 --> 00:07:50,164
You're scaring me over nothing here.

96
00:07:50,544 --> 00:07:53,284
Straw hat might not be the brightest, but he won't lose in a fight.

97
00:07:53,284 --> 00:07:55,504
