167
00:11:21,904 --> 00:11:24,424
I have my Bebra card, of course.

168
00:11:24,624 --> 00:11:26,644
All right, good thing everyone got one, huh?

169
00:11:27,984 --> 00:11:30,824
Let's go. Easy. Follow the card.

170
00:11:31,024 --> 00:11:32,784
We'll be back together in no time.

171
