That way.

172
00:11:38,784 --> 00:11:47,644
Everyone start running and look after yourselves!

173
00:11:47,964 --> 00:11:49,704
We can't win this one!

174
00:11:50,144 --> 00:11:51,484
We're too weak!

175
00:11:51,784 --> 00:11:52,704
Get moving!

176
00:11:53,764 --> 00:11:55,684
Just go! Get out of there!

177
00:11:56,104 --> 00:11:58,664
We can figure out a plan once we're safe!

178
