203
00:14:15,344 --> 00:14:17,084
Yeah, now I'm having fun!

204
00:14:17,084 --> 00:14:18,704
Even though I'm all alone!

205
00:14:19,664 --> 00:14:20,804
Ooh, these look weird.

206
00:14:20,884 --> 00:14:21,764
Let's try them!

207
00:14:23,724 --> 00:14:25,444
Now I'm mad!

208
00:14:27,764 --> 00:14:28,684
Laughing mushrooms!

209
00:14:28,804 --> 00:14:29,464
Laughing mushrooms!

210
00:14:30,804 --> 00:14:31,904
Hey, look!

211
00:14:32,004 --> 00:14:33,104
There's more over here!

212
00:14:33,804 --> 00:14:35,364
Oh, crying mushroom!

213
00:14:42,144 --> 00:14:42,624
Hurry!

214
00:14:42,944 --> 00:14:43,864
I can see the smoke!

215
00:14:44,284 --> 00:14:45,404
It's right over there!

216
00:14:46,124 --> 00:14:48,044
They've been anchored offshore for a while.

217
00:14:48,424 --> 00:14:50,744
You don't think they made landfall in secret, do you?

218
00:14:51,084 --> 00:14:53,324
If so, this could be of great consequence.

219
00:14:53,864 --> 00:14:56,124
True, but that scenario is highly unlikely.

220
00:14:56,464 --> 00:14:58,304
We have heavy security all over the island.

221
00:14:58,684 --> 00:15:01,044
Even if they did find a way to breach our iron defenses,

222
00:15:01,144 --> 00:15:03,944
they would be foolish to draw attention to themselves with a campfire.

223
00:15:04,944 --> 00:15:06,444
Then who could it be?

224
00:15:06,684 --> 00:15:08,324
We'll just have to find out for ourselves.

225
00:15:08,584 --> 00:15:09,844
Let's split up into groups.

226
00:15:09,844 --> 00:15:10,504
Got it!

227
00:15:10,504 --> 00:15:10,664
Got it!

228
00:15:10,664 --> 00:15:33,864
The End

229
00:15:33,864 --> 00:15:42,324
What is that?

230
00:15:42,844 --> 00:15:43,924
Margaret, hurry!

231
00:15:44,204 --> 00:15:45,384
You must see this!

232
00:15:47,044 --> 00:15:47,644
Look!

233
00:15:47,944 --> 00:15:48,404
Look!

234
00:15:48,884 --> 00:15:49,764
Calm down.

235
00:15:49,864 --> 00:15:50,904
I'm right here, Sweet Pea.

236
00:15:51,304 --> 00:15:52,444
What do you make of it?

237
00:15:53,484 --> 00:15:53,764
Huh?

238
00:15:57,164 --> 00:15:59,284
Rather puzzling, isn't it?

239
00:16:00,984 --> 00:16:01,544
Hmm.

240
00:16:03,864 --> 00:16:12,564
Oh, this is terrible!

241
00:16:12,824 --> 00:16:14,024
I think this is a human!

242
00:16:14,364 --> 00:16:15,464
Is she from the village?

243
00:16:16,044 --> 00:16:16,864
I don't know.

244
00:16:17,404 --> 00:16:20,384
There are so many mushrooms growing out of her body, I can't even tell.

245
00:16:21,204 --> 00:16:21,904
Then the fire.

246
00:16:22,724 --> 00:16:25,724
Do you think it may have actually been a call for help?

247
00:16:26,624 --> 00:16:27,104
Hmm.

248
00:16:29,284 --> 00:16:29,724
Aha!

249
00:16:30,484 --> 00:16:31,164
Look here!

250
00:16:31,524 --> 00:16:33,664
