252
00:16:35,204 --> 00:16:38,104
When you eat one, a whole sea of them pop up all over your body.

253
00:16:38,304 --> 00:16:39,484
We have to do something!

254
00:16:39,924 --> 00:16:43,484
Or these mushrooms will sap away all of her strength and she'll die.

255
00:16:43,984 --> 00:16:46,424
Then make haste before all is lost.

256
00:16:47,064 --> 00:16:47,824
