257
00:16:48,164 --> 00:16:49,704
Carry her to the village, and quickly!

258
00:16:52,524 --> 00:16:52,804
K!

259
00:16:53,744 --> 00:16:55,144
Stay strong, small one.

260
00:16:55,284 --> 00:16:56,484
We will find aid.

261
00:16:56,484 --> 00:16:57,444
Let's hope.

262
00:16:57,444 --> 00:17:06,824
We have an emergency!

263
00:17:09,324 --> 00:17:09,924
Hey!

264
00:17:10,144 --> 00:17:11,324
Down in front!

265
00:17:11,724 --> 00:17:12,944
I can't see!

266
00:17:13,444 --> 00:17:13,944
Goodness!

267
00:17:14,304 --> 00:17:14,904
Mushrooms!

268
00:17:15,004 --> 00:17:15,804
What happened?

269
00:17:16,184 --> 00:17:18,344
I haven't seen that girl in the village before.

270
00:17:18,464 --> 00:17:18,864
Have you?

271
00:17:19,204 --> 00:17:19,604
No.

272
00:17:19,824 --> 00:17:20,404
Not me.

273
00:17:20,744 --> 00:17:21,184
Hey!

274
00:17:21,324 --> 00:17:22,404
Who is that?

275
00:17:22,404 --> 00:17:24,704
With all those mushrooms, it's hard to tell.

276
00:17:25,184 --> 00:17:26,804
Any idea where she came from?

277
00:17:26,924 --> 00:17:27,784
Is she alive?

278
00:17:27,984 --> 00:17:30,904
She ate a parasitic mushroom and now they're growing all over her body.

279
00:17:31,244 --> 00:17:33,104
Belladonna, what do you think we should do?

280
00:17:33,244 --> 00:17:35,464
You can pull them off, but we have to get them all.

281
00:17:35,804 --> 00:17:36,444
Be thorough.

282
00:17:36,744 --> 00:17:37,024
Huh?

283
00:17:37,024 --> 00:17:39,724
They come off?

284
00:17:41,544 --> 00:17:42,464
Oh, wow.

285
00:17:44,604 --> 00:17:46,584
But some of the bases are still stuck.

286
00:17:47,544 --> 00:17:48,264
Don't worry.

287
00:17:48,544 --> 00:17:49,744
I'll take care of them later.

288
00:17:50,044 --> 00:17:50,944
Just keep pulling.

289
00:17:51,504 --> 00:17:52,524
She's so odd.

290
00:17:52,664 --> 00:17:54,484
Are you sure that this was wise?

291
00:17:54,664 --> 00:17:55,404
What could I do?

292
00:17:55,724 --> 00:17:57,484
She was barely alive when we found her.

293
00:17:57,744 --> 00:17:59,204
I thought she might be from the village.

294
00:18:00,364 --> 00:18:00,764
Phew.

295
00:18:03,084 --> 00:18:04,344
Well, that should do it.

296
00:18:04,384 --> 00:18:04,684
Good.

297
00:18:05,144 --> 00:18:06,324
Now step back a bit.

298
00:18:07,024 --> 00:18:07,584
Huh?

299
00:18:19,644 --> 00:18:20,044
No!

300
00:18:25,444 --> 00:18:26,504
I'm on fire!

301
00:18:26,724 --> 00:18:27,364
Put me out!

302
00:18:28,824 --> 00:18:29,704
Hold on.

303
00:18:29,964 --> 00:18:30,584
Belladonna!

304
00:18:30,884 --> 00:18:31,864
What are you doing?

305
00:18:32,264 --> 00:18:34,644
This is the only way to keep them from growing back.

306
00:18:34,644 --> 00:18:38,904
Still, it seems a bit excessive.

307
00:18:40,724 --> 00:18:42,044
She passed out again.

308
00:18:44,044 --> 00:18:45,124
Well, that's interesting.

309
00:18:45,384 --> 00:18:48,884
It seems she was covered in injuries before she was covered in mushrooms.

310
00:18:48,884 --> 00:18:50,024
She was?

311
00:18:50,544 --> 00:18:53,044
She must have gone through quite the terrible battle.

312
00:18:53,684 --> 00:18:55,044
We need to treat her wounds.

313
00:18:55,744 --> 00:18:56,884
Do me a favor, Margaret.

314
00:18:57,304 --> 00:19:00,224
Take her down to the river and give her a good bath.

315
00:19:00,904 --> 00:19:01,904
Uh, yes.

316
00:19:02,584 --> 00:19:03,444
Yes, of course.

317
00:19:03,444 --> 00:19:26,604
Well, it appears that she's not from the village after all.

318
00:19:26,604 --> 00:19:27,524
How strange.

319
00:19:27,684 --> 00:19:28,104
Yes.

320
00:19:28,844 --> 00:19:29,144
Huh?

321
00:19:30,464 --> 00:19:31,344
Hold on.

322
00:19:31,524 --> 00:19:32,384
What is this?

323
00:19:32,524 --> 00:19:33,304
Is something wrong?

324
00:19:33,564 --> 00:19:35,864
We've been remiss in our mushroom picking duties.

325
00:19:36,164 --> 00:19:38,244
There's one between her legs that we failed to catch.

326
00:19:38,444 --> 00:19:39,544
How careless of us.

327
00:19:42,544 --> 00:19:43,044
Huh.

328
00:19:43,044 --> 00:19:46,604
You're right, but this one seems different than the others, doesn't it?

329
00:19:47,264 --> 00:19:48,984
It has such a strange shape.

330
00:19:49,464 --> 00:19:50,304
Wait, look.

331
00:19:50,544 --> 00:19:51,304
It's another one.

332
00:19:51,604 --> 00:19:52,184
Here, see?

333
00:19:52,664 --> 00:19:53,464
Right on the bottom.

334
00:19:53,884 --> 00:19:55,984
It appears to be some sort of sack mushroom.

335
00:19:56,264 --> 00:19:56,824
Better plot.

336
00:19:56,824 --> 00:20:04,184
It won't come off.

337
00:20:04,424 --> 00:20:05,024
But why?

338
00:20:05,584 --> 00:20:07,344
Hey, what's going on?

339
00:20:07,424 --> 00:20:08,284
What happened?

340
00:20:08,504 --> 00:20:09,324
It's stretching.

341
00:20:09,784 --> 00:20:10,404
What is?

342
00:20:10,704 --> 00:20:11,324
A mushroom.

343
00:20:11,804 --> 00:20:12,584
Let me see.

344
00:20:12,744 --> 00:20:13,844
That sounds funny.

345
00:20:16,304 --> 00:20:17,144
That's enough.

346
00:20:17,324 --> 00:20:18,624
Stop gawking, ladies.

347
00:20:18,744 --> 00:20:20,224
They aren't putting on a show for you.

348
00:20:20,324 --> 00:20:20,884
Huh?

349
00:20:21,204 --> 00:20:22,904
If we leave, so do you.

350
00:20:23,364 --> 00:20:24,164
Hey, look.

351
00:20:24,284 --> 00:20:25,764
That isn't normal, is it?

352
00:20:26,104 --> 00:20:27,104
It's strange.

353
00:20:27,404 --> 00:20:28,284
She's sort of rugged.

354
00:20:28,704 --> 00:20:30,144
Not very well endowed, either.

355
00:20:34,264 --> 00:20:35,524
It's no use.

356
00:20:36,084 --> 00:20:37,324
Come over here, Afalandra.

357
00:20:37,324 --> 00:20:38,544
Afalandra, you give it a try.

358
00:20:39,024 --> 00:20:39,344
Me?

359
00:20:39,604 --> 00:20:40,264
Are you sure?

360
00:20:40,664 --> 00:20:41,584
Mm-hmm.

361
00:20:42,064 --> 00:20:43,164
Give it a yank.

362
00:20:43,264 --> 00:20:45,004
It'll come right off.

363
00:20:45,384 --> 00:20:46,944
Why don't we all pull on it?

364
00:20:47,044 --> 00:20:47,704
That'll work.

365
00:20:48,284 --> 00:20:48,704
No.

366
00:20:49,044 --> 00:20:49,424
Huh?

367
00:20:49,904 --> 00:20:51,944
If the mushroom refuses to come off,

368
00:20:52,784 --> 00:20:56,864
then we must burn it as Belladonna did,

369
00:20:57,024 --> 00:20:58,944
until naught but ashes remain.

370
00:20:59,184 --> 00:21:01,004
Yes, a splendid idea.

371
00:21:01,284 --> 00:21:02,364
Wouldn't you agree, Margaret?

372
00:21:02,624 --> 00:21:03,584
Sure, burn away.

373
00:21:04,844 --> 00:21:05,544
Oh, my.

374
00:21:05,544 --> 00:21:06,524
What's this?

375
00:21:06,684 --> 00:21:07,824
Is something wrong?

376
00:21:08,224 --> 00:21:09,764
Oh, hello, Granny Nyon.

377
00:21:10,304 --> 00:21:12,084
There's a mushroom growing on this girl

378
00:21:12,084 --> 00:21:14,084
that won't come off no matter how hard we try.

379
00:21:14,424 --> 00:21:16,184
Do you think we should all pull it together?

380
00:21:16,404 --> 00:21:17,764
Or just burn it off?

381
00:21:18,804 --> 00:21:19,964
Oh, goodness.

382
00:21:20,604 --> 00:21:21,824
But who is she?

383
00:21:22,824 --> 00:21:23,384
Hmm.

384
00:21:25,124 --> 00:21:26,904
The mushroom's a mystery, too.

385
00:21:27,864 --> 00:21:28,664
Let's see.

386
00:21:28,664 --> 00:21:33,224
Where could it be?

387
00:21:34,484 --> 00:21:35,844
Oh, no!

388
00:21:37,464 --> 00:21:38,104
Whoa.

389
00:21:38,624 --> 00:21:41,064
Hey, Granny Nyon, you aren't ill, are you?

390
00:21:41,764 --> 00:21:44,104
No, everything is just fine.

391
00:21:44,484 --> 00:21:47,424
Except that this person is a...

392
00:21:47,424 --> 00:21:57,424
This person is a...

393
00:21:58,104 --> 00:21:58,524
Hey.

394
00:21:59,284 --> 00:21:59,844
Hey.

395
00:22:00,444 --> 00:22:01,704
It's a man!

396
00:22:01,884 --> 00:22:02,624
A man!

397
00:22:02,624 --> 00:22:03,464
A man!

398
00:22:03,464 --> 00:22:04,324
No!

399
00:22:04,324 --> 00:22:30,664
I've never seen a man before.

400
00:22:30,664 --> 00:22:32,964
Whatever shall I do?

401
00:22:36,304 --> 00:22:39,484
Here lies the maiden island of Amazon Lily,

402
00:22:39,924 --> 00:22:42,084
inhabited by a tribe of female warriors

403
00:22:42,084 --> 00:22:43,264
known as the Kuja.

404
00:22:45,204 --> 00:22:47,904
Woe be to the man who dreams of this land,

405
00:22:48,144 --> 00:22:50,304
and woe be to the man who seeks it.

406
00:22:50,564 --> 00:22:53,204
For if they shall ever set foot upon its soil,

407
00:22:53,864 --> 00:22:56,244
death surely awaits them.

408
00:22:56,244 --> 00:23:09,424
Captured by the women of Amazon Lily,

409
00:23:09,704 --> 00:23:10,744
Luffy tries to escape

410
00:23:10,744 --> 00:23:12,324
and hopes of reuniting with his friends.

411
00:23:12,684 --> 00:23:15,444
However, the snake princess is returning to the island,

412
00:23:15,664 --> 00:23:17,684
and if she learns a man has been brought to the village,

413
00:23:17,824 --> 00:23:19,884
both Luffy and the women who rescued him

414
00:23:19,884 --> 00:23:21,424
could pay the ultimate price.

415
00:23:22,084 --> 00:23:23,364
On the next One Piece,

416
00:23:23,704 --> 00:23:25,124
hurry back to your friends,

417
00:23:25,124 --> 00:23:26,784
the maiden island adventure.

418
00:23:27,204 --> 00:23:28,824
I'm gonna be king of the pirates!

